# WebUI frontend unit tests

Before writing or editing `*.spec.ts` under `Web/WebUI/**`:

1. [`Web/WebUI/.agents/RULES/testing/tests-authoring-workflow.md`](../../Web/WebUI/.agents/RULES/testing/tests-authoring-workflow.md) (first)
2. [`Web/WebUI/.agents/RULES/testing/tests-writing-principles.md`](../../Web/WebUI/.agents/RULES/testing/tests-writing-principles.md)
3. Skill [`webui-testing`](../../.agents/skills/webui-testing/SKILL.md)

If the spec is under `iap/**`, also load [`iap-unit-test-run`](../../.agents/skills/iap-unit-test-run/SKILL.md) and run the mandated `ng test iap --configuration=withConfig` command after edits.
